---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EmailLink from '../components/EmailLink.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${siteConfig.siteName} handles data: what is collected (currently nothing), hosting via Cloudflare, and your rights under GDPR.`}
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero">
      <span class="badge">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This page explains what happens to your data when you visit this
        site, in line with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="padding-block: 1rem 3rem;">
      <h2>Data controller</h2>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.ownerName}<br />
        {siteConfig.address}<br />
        {siteConfig.postalCode} {siteConfig.city}, {siteConfig.country}<br />
        Email: <EmailLink email={siteConfig.email} />
      </p>

      <h2>What this website collects</h2>
      <p>
        Currently, this website does not use cookies, does not run analytics
        or tracking scripts, and does not embed any third-party trackers. It
        does not have accounts, forms, or newsletters. Browsing this site
        does not create a personal profile of you.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on Cloudflare's infrastructure. To deliver pages
        and keep the site secure, Cloudflare processes standard server log
        data as part of operating its network, including your IP address,
        browser type, the page requested, and the time of the request. This
        happens automatically for any website served over the internet and
        is necessary for the legitimate interest of running and securing the
        site (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). We do not access this data for tracking or
        marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact by email</h2>
      <p>
        If you email us at the address above, we store your message and
        email address only for as long as needed to read and respond to
        it, and only to handle that specific inquiry. We do not add your
        address to a mailing list, use it for any other purpose, or share it
        with third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights under GDPR</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request access to any personal data we hold about you (Art. 15)</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate data (Art. 16)</li>
        <li>Request erasure of your data (Art. 17)</li>
        <li>Request restriction of processing (Art. 18)</li>
        <li>Request a copy of your data in a portable format (Art. 20)</li>
        <li>Object to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the email address
        above.
      </p>

      <h2>Right to complain</h2>
      <p>
        You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Austrian data
        protection authority:
      </p>
      <p>
        Österreichische Datenschutzbehörde (DSB)<br />
        Barichgasse 40-42, 1030 Vienna, Austria<br />
        Website: <a href="https://www.dsb.gv.at" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.dsb.gv.at</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
